{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「DJ女神」樂宜（Lokyii）近年積極開拓副業，早前該品牌的實體專門店搬到旺角區，而最令人驚喜的，莫過於久未在港公開露面的「烏鴉哥」張耀揚亦有現身力撐！</p><figure><img alt=\"大讚好人！（IG照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154857210850185216623018.jpeg/xykecmWXqSjHamwQ06Mdr-Q39pxnIo5plcGP65XBj-s\"/><figcaption>大讚好人！（IG照片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私下是好朋友！（IG照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154857208060841984025963.jpeg/8GljrMLf3ctqEIcjRozJUyPvkFx4n7LMqx93Q6sfd0M\"/><figcaption>私下是好朋友！（IG照片）</figcaption></figure><p>現年62歲的張耀揚雖然留有一頭標誌性的型格銀白長髮及鬍鬚，但身形依然維持得極之健碩，男人味十足。他當日在現場不僅與樂宜及同場嘉賓親切合照，更非常給面子地在店內親自挑選運動服飾，一邊摸衫一邊與樂宜交流，毫無明星架子。</p><figure><img alt=\"好認真！（IG照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154857205019840512315297.jpeg/Zz-lyQw06Id01MCfmme3YBUOt41bUdEXgzm9sIM5vbA\"/><figcaption>好認真！（IG照片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"零架子！（IG照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154857202016587776031982.jpeg/v6bfs3cgzVgGO0bVX2VezFKFDZKTVdQmpOl3OqTpdzo\"/><figcaption>零架子！（IG照片）</figcaption></figure><p>老闆娘樂宜當日則穿上自家品牌的黑色運動Bra Top，大曬纖腰與豐滿身材。談到今次創業，樂宜透露自己投資了高達6位數：「依家生意其實好不錯，我都好想開多幾間分店，所以暫時都未正式回本。」至於大家最關心的，是她如何與風馬牛不相及的「烏鴉哥」張耀揚結緣？樂宜隨即甜笑解釋：「其實我打碟嘅時候撞到耀揚哥，之後大家傾得埋就變成了朋友。佢私底下真係好好人、好Nice！」</p><figure><img alt=\"生意越做越好！（IG/@lok_lokyii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154857630339174400927085.jpeg/2JdfJvSJXWnWedVwAOHyaLNMnUgYzB0mbfBZPW3wWT0\"/><figcaption>生意越做越好！（IG/@lok_lokyii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生意越做越好！（IG/@lok_lokyii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154857627822460928015632.jpeg/8VlteI6eKqNgIqcMRJipdha72s8p5D8T6Me83ujHvN4\"/><figcaption>生意越做越好！（IG/@lok_lokyii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生意越做越好！（IG/@lok_lokyii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154857624999563264231658.jpeg/cjwSVAnoGyqvwZBE_e68IP5XCp_ZJ0hgR6byokem8qI\"/><figcaption>生意越做越好！（IG/@lok_lokyii）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T06:38:09.017123+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":486,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}